# Security toolchain (D-48)

Complementary AppSec stack — does **not** replace D-47 AuthZ/IDOR, money SoR, Promptfoo, or Appendix C.

| Phase | Tool | In-repo |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Planning | OWASP Threat Dragon | `ThreatDragonModels/` + `docs/threat-models/` |
| SAST | Semgrep CE | `semgrep.yml`, `semgrep/rules/` — CI job `semgrep-dial` **hard-fails** |
| IaC | Checkov | `.github/workflows/checkov.yml` — hard-fail HIGH/CRITICAL |
| Deps | Renovate primary | `renovate.json`; Dependabot **alerts only** |
| Pre-prod | Strix (`usestrix/strix`) | `docs/security/strix-runbook.md` — **staging only**, never prod |

Custom Semgrep echoes D-47: no body `userId`/email/role; no `NEXT_PUBLIC_`/`VITE_` secrets; webhook signature heuristic; ban Baileys/`whatsapp-web.js`; optional raw SQL concat.

